# Bifidobacterium longum subsp. longum, the five locus MLVA of Matamoros et al. 2011, run as one
# multiplex PCR. Primers are Table 2 as published. Some forward primers were made without a 5' G on
# the dye-labelled strand; the dye and that design detail are assay properties and the oligonucleotide
# is written here as in Table 2. The search window is derived: the measured product widened by twenty
# repeats each way, which covers the published size range of every locus.
VNTR12	AGGTATTCGGGGATGTTCGC	GTATGGCGACGGCACATTCC	397-761
VNTR21	GCCTGTCATTCGCCGTTCTG	ATCACCCAGCGTGTTTCGG	350-566
VNTR23	TCGATCTTGAACTCGCACACC	TGCTTGACCTGCCATTCACC	344-574
VNTR25	AATCGTGATTCCAGGTGCGG	CGTCGCATTCATACGGTCGG	331-655
VNTR26	ACTGCATGTTCCGCAATACCC	ATGTCGGCGGCTTTGTAGTG	114-474
